>> Animal := Bagay bago.
>> Factory := Bagay bago.

Animal kapag: ['bago'] gawin: {
	>> animal := sarili bago.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal kapag: ['sound:'] gawin: { :s
	sarili-ko sound := s.
}.

Animal kapag: ['sound'] gawin: { <- sarili-ko sound.
}.

>> Dog := Bagay bago.
>> Cat := Bagay bago.

Dog kapag: ['bago'] gawin: { <- Animal bago sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat kapag: ['bago'] gawin: { <- Animal bago sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Labas isulat: Dog bago sound, bagong-linya.
Labas isulat: Cat bago sound, bagong-linya.

Factory kapag: ['mix:and:'] gawin: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal bago sound: (
		( beast1 sound mula-sa: 0 haba: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound mula-sa: 2 haba: 5 )
	).
}.

Labas isulat: (Factory mix: Dog bago and: Cat bago) sound, bagong-linya.
